# EDUGUARD
# COMPREHENSIVE GOVERNMENT & PRIVATE SCHOOL INTEGRATION SPECIFICATION

## 1. CORE PLATFORM OBJECTIVE

EduGuard is a centralized Education Department Management, School Administration, Public Complaint, Monitoring, and Inspection Platform.

The platform must manage BOTH:

1. Government Schools
2. Private Schools

The platform must not prioritize one school category over the other. Both school categories must be treated as first-class entities with complete support throughout the application.

The Education Minister / Super Admin is responsible for supervising the entire education ecosystem.

The system must support multiple provinces, districts, cities, school types, education levels, school owners, government representatives, teachers, parents, students, and inspection officers.

The application should be scalable enough to support thousands of schools and hundreds of thousands of users.

IMPORTANT:
Do not implement government and private schools as two separate applications. Build one centralized platform with shared functionality, ownership-specific permissions, and configurable workflows.

