- Government Primary School
- Government Elementary School
- Government Secondary School
- Government Higher Secondary School
- Government Girls School
- Government Boys School
- Government Model School
- Government Special Education School
- Government Technical School

### Private School

An independently owned or privately operated educational institution.

Examples:

- Private Primary School
- Private Elementary School
- Private Secondary School
- Private Higher Secondary School
